WEBVTT

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.190
Three days since Alone came here...

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:36.860
The Sanctuary's restoration is underway.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.500
But everyone is panicked

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:43.330
because of the painting the
King of the Underworld brought to Earth.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:48.330
The painting that, when completed,
will end life in the world.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:56.980
The Lost Canvas.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:03.680
Hey, Tenma!

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.460
Ouch! Dohko!

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:09.190
You've looked so unlike yourself!

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:11.900
If you're just going to stare
into space, then work! Fool!

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:14.900
Okay.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.150
Crap!

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:20.380
I thought you had died.
Then you came back, out of nowhere.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.490
When the King of the Underworld came here,

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:25.290
I had no idea that you were
in that sealed land, too.

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:29.380
Honestly... You're always surprising me.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:31.170
I'm just glad you're safe.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.420
Well, I'm safe, but...

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:41.250
This guy, Sisyphos, was hit
by the arrow Alone redirected...

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.180
I met that guy once, a long time ago.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.680
I wanted to talk to him again,
but he wouldn't open his eyes.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:55.180
The Pope told me that an attack
from the King of the Underworld

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:57.740
hurts your soul directly.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:02.070
That must be why he wouldn't wake up.

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:05.580
Alone... The King of the Underworld's power...

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:10.250
At this point, Sisyphos may never wake up again.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.880
Tenma...

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:21.630
Sorry. But honestly, I'm a little bummed out.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:24.380
Messing up the Sanctuary like this...

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.760
Shooting Sisyphos,

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:30.450
trying to kill Sasha without remorse,
trying to destroy the world...

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:33.770
He really isn't the kind of guy

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.930
who'd be capable of doing such things...

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:40.380
How can he be Hades?

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.780
It's a real shame. But, Tenma...

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:48.290
I can't have sympathy for your friend anymore.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:52.590
And everyone in the Sanctuary must feel that way.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.310
He is the Earth's powerful enemy,

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.580
and we must focus all our efforts on destroying him.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:58.670
However,

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.500
though it may seem contradictory for me

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:06.460
to not want you to extinguish
your deep flames of friendship...

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:09.180
Dohko...

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:13.180
Several years ago, Sisyphos told me that he had met

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.780
a young boy who was very committed to his friends.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:21.530
Thinking about it now, I believe he
was talking about you, Tenma.

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:25.340
And your fate, and the King of
the Underworld's, has carried over

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:28.580
from the days of myth, as Asmita mentioned.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:33.000
I can't help but think that this is where
our one-in-a-million hope lies.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.930
So, Tenma...

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:38.130
Continue to think of your friend,
and move straight forward.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:42.510
I'm doing that anyway.
I really never learn.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.560
That's the spirit.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.760
Sir Dohko! Tenma!

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:52.270
Sir Aldebaran requests your
assistance with the clearing

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.020
of the destroyed temple.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.150
Yeah!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.030
I'll carry it all!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.520
Thank you so much!

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.430
This way!

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:14.070
<i>I can't tell if he's just putting
on a bold face or what...</i>

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:15.710
<i>He'll do anything if there's something in it for him.</i>

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:20.430
<i>But when I think of the great pressures</i>

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:22.360
<i>that await this young boy...</i>

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:29.820
<i>You've got a tough road ahead, Tenma.</i>

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:36.630
Lady Pandora...

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:41.770
Why did Lord Hades go to the Sanctuary on his own?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.920
Lady Pandora?

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.490
<i>It is true that Lord Hades</i>

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.770
<i>is coming into his role as Lord of the Underworld,</i>

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:51.560
<i>growing stronger and more dignified daily.</i>

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:54.910
<i>Yet, I feel uneasy...</i>

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:57.160
<i>Could Lord Hades be...</i>

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:06.720
You... You two are...

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:08.220
Sir Thanatos.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:09.970
Sir Hypnos.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.150
You're too slow, Pandora.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.670
Wh-What?

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:19.480
Why are you, the gods of Sleep and Death, here?

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:23.730
I've done nothing that calls for your intervention.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.340
Silence.

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:29.570
We arranged everything up till now,

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:32.370
but you've undermined it all
with this Sanctuary incident!

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:35.740
But... That was something even I could not...

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.540
Don't be so unseemly, Pandora!

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.130
Pandora.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.630
If this lies beyond your ability,

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.040
we will assume the duties that allow Lord Hades

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:55.080
to focus completely on his Lost Canvas.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:58.310
And we will prepare a special atelier for him.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:03.910
So that the thought of leaving by himself
will not enter his mind again.

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:09.930
Meanwhile, you root out the causes
of Lord Hades's insecurities.

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:13.030
Pandora...

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.560
You know what they are.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.040
Yes, I do.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.280
That hateful Athena...

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.040
But the truly hateful one is...

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:30.050
Is the one deep in Lord Hades's heart.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:32.930
<i>The impurity...</i>

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.040
Pegasus Tenma!

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.600
Is my assassin here?

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:44.350
Name yourself!

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:46.570
Kill Pegasus Tenma!

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:51.590
<i>Destroy his soul, so he can never return to life!</i>

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:54.570
L-Lady Pandora, why are you here?

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:58.880
Earthly Secret Star, Dullahan Cube,

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:00.980
and Earthly Searching Star, Bat Wimber.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:07.340
I see. You two may be perfectly suited to this job.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:13.640
Taking care of the Bronze Pegasus Saint
will not pose a problem.

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:17.300
We'll seek him under the cover of darkness

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.720
and kill him swiftly, before he knows what hit him.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.060
I await favorable news.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:28.080
<i>Now the one causing Lord Hades's
soul turmoil will vanish,</i>

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:30.910
<i>as will the uneasiness in my heart.</i>

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:33.800
<i>And the twin gods will be happy.</i>

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:35.970
<i>Lord Hades...</i>

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:41.750
<i>Please guide us with your will,
to command the Specter army.</i>

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:54.170
This is a parting gift, Virgo.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.930
Although...

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:03.540
I don't even know if you drink!

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:09.320
The Holy War is reaching its climax.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:15.280
Lady Athena and the Pope now make
preparations for the advance.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.700
The final battle is near.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:24.550
The Pope has received the rosaries
you purified with your Cosmo.

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:30.500
We'll be sure to dye those
rosary beads with Specters' souls.

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:39.320
Sorry to trouble you with
my unusual conversation.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:46.850
I would've loved to have seen
your power on the battlefield.

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:57.030
<i>Bats?</i>

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.240
<i>That's a lot of them.</i>

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.630
You're still no match for me!

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.690
I never taught you to fight like that.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.390
Sir Aldebaran?

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.190
E-Excuse me!

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.790
Sir Aldebaran.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:28.890
Thank you.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:32.400
Your sparring partner today was a tough one.

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:34.650
Sorry to barge in!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.530
And that's just fine...

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:49.540
Is that all?

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:53.290
Well, I heard from Dohko that
you were getting a little sluggish.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.460
But I guess you haven't lost your fighting spirit.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:57.920
That's right!

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:00.280
<i>Pegasus...</i>

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.300
<i>Meteor Fist!</i>

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:12.350
I see... Good punches.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.060
But you've got a ways to go

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.320
before you'll be a match for
the King of the Underworld.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.720
You must continue to practice!

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:26.660
You really go for it. It's already night.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.990
Hey, Saro! Don't sleep!

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:31.640
You can't blame him.

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.570
Even I'm about to fall asleep from boredom, too.

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:35.420
Celintha!

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:40.240
Me, too?

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.060
Here I come!

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.150
Pegasus Saint?

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.070
<i>Wh-What's happening?</i>

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:04.260
Good job, my little ones.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:08.200
Make those Sanctuary idiots sleep...

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:12.610
With your <i>Nightmare Sonar</i>!

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:35.310
Hey, Wimber.

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:38.350
You did well.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:46.000
How silly. What Lady Pandora feared so was naught but a Bronze Saint.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.450
He was nothing.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.350
Pegasus Saint, I'll take...

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.540
your head!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.790
Stop!

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:04.050
I see that even now, some rats still
attempt to enter the Sanctuary!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:08.050
You want the Pegasus Saint,
but you cannot have him.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:10.310
Wh-What?

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.310
How can you be awake in the <i>Nightmare Sonar</i>?

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:15.310
I can't hear you.

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:20.570
You burst your eardrums?

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:24.630
<i>Great Horn!</i>

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:36.080
Is that all you've got?

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:41.880
That's not enough to
slaughter me or the Pegasus Saint.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:42.590
Crap.

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.340
Bats...

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:53.260
From the blind spot of my right eye!

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.370
Bursting your own eardrums

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.860
to immunize yourself from my <i>Nightmare Sonar</i>...

00:13:57.860 --> 00:14:00.020
You're a funny guy.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.450
But it was all for nothing!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:08.140
The special ultrasound waves
may not have made you sleep,

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:11.410
but they've hit your nerves and
stolen your coordination.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.250
Blood from the Taurus Saint.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:16.450
Let's go.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.660
Wait!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:20.540
Let me have a turn.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.920
He even blew away my mask.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.550
I'll make him pay.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:29.330
Lady Pandora's orders were only
to assassinate the Pegasus Saint.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:34.510
But surely, she'd be pleased if we got rid of a Gold Saint, as well.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.520
Die, Taurus Saint!

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:46.280
Let me have some more fun!

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:53.580
<i>The injuries from my fight against
Kagaho have reopened.</i>

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:01.790
How do you like that?

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.400
You can't move as freely as you want, can you?

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.130
You're just a lifeless stump now.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.520
Die!

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:17.030
Disappear!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.690
This is the end!

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:31.910
What?

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.540
I can't hear.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:41.920
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.790
But I know, at least,

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.300
that your punches are nothing to worry about!

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:54.760
I won't let the likes of you kill the Pegasus Saint!

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.050
What kind of a...

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.230
man are you?

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.130
H-How dare you?

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:15.090
If that's how much you long for death,
I'll grant your wish!

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.490
<i>Death Messenger!</i>

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:29.090
The words that woman chants are words of death.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:32.060
Even if you cover your ears,

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:35.360
the words will sink into your skin, and eventually...

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:39.060
They will stop your heartbeat!

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:55.030
You're finally down.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.120
Took you long enough...

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:03.990
Which means I can finally take
the Pegasus Saint's head.

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.750
<i>Sir Rasgado!</i>

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.670
<i>This may be a Holy War,</i>

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:16.180
<i>but a Saint's death
would sadden Lady Athena.</i>

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.430
<i>That's right.</i>

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:29.930
<i>You...</i>

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:32.690
<i>who have your lives ahead of you...</i>

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.780
<i>The power each of you deems
sufficient is good enough.</i>

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:41.200
No way! You...

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.580
Your heart should have stopped!

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:51.100
<i>Live...</i>

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:55.250
<i>Live powerfully.</i>

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:59.960
<i>Titan's Nova!</i>

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.630
Who would have guessed
that there was another assassin...

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.250
I'm sure the Taurus Saint didn't even know!

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:37.260
I, the Earthly Strange Star, Frog Zelos!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.310
Now I can get all the credit!

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:43.260
I'd better hurry up and get the
Pegasus Saint's head and run!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:48.240
Out of my way, cow.

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:49.550
Don't waste my time!

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:51.020
Tubby! Idiot!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:52.970
You're supposed to be dead!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.770
Just fall, already!

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.580
Heavenly Savage Star, Bennu Kagaho!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.410
I don't care for you.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.600
I'm sure Lord Hades would not approve
of the way you're going about this.

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:17.350
Speak! Who ordered the
Pegasus Saint's assassination?

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:19.830
Why do you need to know?

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:24.500
You want to take the credit that's
rightfully mine, don't you?

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.930
You hyena! Move your foot!

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:33.500
All right! I'll tell you! I'll tell you!

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:36.360
Lady Pandora ordered this!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.520
What happened to Lord Hades?

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.880
Lord Hades is focusing completely on completing

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:44.700
the Lost Canvas by himself.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.170
The Lost Canvas...

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:49.310
This is just between us,

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:53.210
but Lady Pandora's starting to get
a little suspicious of Lord Hades.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:57.960
Like, is he really the reincarnation of Lord Hades?

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.300
This job proves it, too!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:04.920
Lady Pandora was apparently so frustrated,
she ordered this on her own.

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:09.470
Lady Pandora has all the power over
the Specter army now, too.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.450
So what do you say, Kagaho?

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:14.980
How about getting this job done and
obtaining Lady Pandora's favor!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:21.910
I have no intention of taking orders
from anyone but Lord Hades!

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:34.000
Huh? Why... When did I...

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.540
Where's Aldebaran?

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.930
It was no easy task getting him to lie down.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:49.560
He's a staunch man, even in death.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:50.930
Specter...

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:52.140
Did you...

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:56.190
Did you kill Aldebaran?

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.570
<i>This guy's real strong.</i>

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:10.080
I'm sorry to say that I did not kill the Taurus Saint.

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.080
What a lightweight!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:19.430
The Specters will send assassins,
one after the other, for you.

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:21.710
This is just the beginning.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.470
<i>After me?</i>

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.970
<i>So Aldebaran...</i>

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:31.600
Wait!

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:36.100
Did Alone... Did Hades order this?

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.110
Pandora did.

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:43.560
The Specters are no longer led by Lord Hades,

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:47.240
but by that woman, essentially.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.070
What do you mean? What about Alone?

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:51.220
If you want to know,

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:54.330
go look for yourself.

00:21:59.740 --> 00:22:02.760
<i>Taurus Saint, I've repaid my debt.</i>

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:08.100
Sir Aldebaran!

00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:11.680
Sir Aldebaran, why...

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:14.180
What do you mean, Tenma?

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:16.810
Why did Sir Aldebaran die?

00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:24.070
Sorry...

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:04.330
Alone...

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:07.500
Aldebaran died for me.

00:24:08.100 --> 00:24:11.300
If it weren't for me, he wouldn't have died.

00:24:12.020 --> 00:24:14.050
I can't return to the Sanctuary anymore.

00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:17.750
I'll put an end to this Holy War myself.

00:24:18.510 --> 00:24:20.310
Wait for me, Alone.

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:23.300
I'm coming to see you now.

00:24:24.460 --> 00:24:27.260
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:27.260 --> 00:24:28.440
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...

00:24:29.130 --> 00:24:30.250
The Departure.
